  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-102847\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>A mathematical statement is a sentence or mathematical expression that is either true or false. </p>\n<p>Of the given sentences, the only sentence that is either true or false is \"A rectangle has four angles.\" (This sentence is true.)</p>\n<p>All the other sentences are neither true nor false.</p>\n<div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\"> How do you find the perimeter of a square?</div></div>",
